# Scientific Reproduction

Use this Skill when the user wants to reproduce a scientific paper, build a full reproduction plan, execute/monitor experiment or compute reproduction goals, or resume an existing reproduction project.

## Entry

Primary semantic command: `/reproduce <PDF|DOI|URL>`.

## Governance

Load and obey the project state, locked architecture decisions, role contracts and frozen Goal/Analysis/Acceptance records. Never allow a worker to make Supervisor-level scientific decisions.

## Runtime

Delegate deterministic state, schema, lock, event and adapter operations to the package runtime. Delegate scientific planning and adjudication to the Supervisor role.
